'''Boulder Stretch Rope''' is a earth-type [[Spells|spell]] that shapes stone into a flexible ribbon.

==Description==
Boulder stretch contains a central earth sigil with a single weave keystone wrapped around it. This spell turns stone into a flexible ribbon that can be used for many purposes.

==Usage==
This spell was created and used by Richeh to cross a gap in the road of the [[Serpentback Cave|serpent-back cave]].{{Ref|m|21|94}}

It was also used by [[Agott]], [[Coco]] and [[Tetia]] to capture [[Euini|Wolf Euini]].

